# Copy to `.env` and fill in (never commit real secrets).
# Load in app code via `process.env` only on the server, or use Meteor settings for non-secret config.

# Gemini API — used by server/main.js to verify submitted photos, and to
# power live AI-generated riddles (imports/api/riddles/geminiClient.js).
# Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional — defaults to gemini-3-flash-preview if unset
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3-flash-preview
